--------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains CAD geometry produced by third parties. It is
included so that the CAD -> URDF pipeline is reproducible. It is NOT covered
by the Apache-2.0 licence above and remains the property of its respective
owners, redistributed here under their original terms.

1. cad/actuators/robstride02_official.step
   ROBSTRIDE RS02 actuator, published by RobStride at
   https://github.com/RobStride/Product_Information
   Provenance, including the source URL and a SHA-256 of the original file,
   is recorded in cad/actuators/provenance.json.

2. cad/robot/onshape_export/meshes/RMDX8V3.stl
   MyActuator RMD-X8 V3 geometry, imported into the Onshape assembly as a
   placeholder during design. It is NOT used by the generated robot model:
   tools/cad_to_model.py substitutes the ROBSTRIDE02 envelope and mass in its
   place. Retained only so the original assembly can be re-imported.

If you are the owner of either and would prefer it not be redistributed here,
open an issue and it will be removed; the pipeline can regenerate from a
locally supplied copy instead.

